---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: About | StarBlaze Ventures
description: StarBlaze Ventures helps small and growing businesses build a real digital presence.
---
{% from "macros/image-placeholder.njk" import imagePlaceholder %}
{% from "macros/button.njk" import button %}
{% set enquiryUrl = business.contact.phone | whatsappLink("Hi StarBlaze, I'd like to talk about my business.") %}

<section class="page-hero">
  <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
  <h1>We're StarBlaze Ventures.</h1>
  <p class="lede">One team for your whole digital presence: the website, the hosting, and the marketing and automation that make it work for the business behind it.</p>
</section>

<section class="split">
  <div class="split__text">
    <h2>Why we exist</h2>
    <p>StarBlaze Ventures works with small and growing businesses that want a real digital presence, not just a website, but the hosting, marketing, and automation that make that website actually work.</p>
    <p>We started StarBlaze because we kept seeing the same problem: businesses either paid too much for scattered, disconnected services, or did without because "digital" felt overwhelming. So we built a single team that handles the whole stack, giving our clients one point of contact and one team that's accountable for results.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="split__media">
    {{ imagePlaceholder("StarBlaze Ventures team collaborating", "4/3", "/assets/images/about-team.jpg") }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stat-strip" aria-label="At a glance">
  <div><strong>{{ services.length }}</strong><span>services under one roof</span></div>
  <div><strong>1</strong><span>team, one point of contact</span></div>
  <div><strong>100%</strong><span>fully managed, we keep things running</span></div>
</section>

<section class="detail-section">
  <h2>What we believe</h2>
  <div class="value-grid">
    <div class="side-card">
      <h3>Fully managed means fully managed</h3>
      <p>We don't hand you a login and walk away. We keep things running.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="side-card">
      <h3>Tools should save you time</h3>
      <p>Every service we offer exists to give business owners their time back.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="side-card">
      <h3>Right-sized, not over-sold</h3>
      <p>We recommend what your business needs at its current size, not the most expensive package we have.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="detail-section">
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <ul class="pill-list">
    {% for service in services %}<li><a href="/services/{{ service.slug }}/">{{ service.title }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="signature-card signature-card--dark cta-band">
  <h2>Ready to talk about your business?</h2>
  <p>Tell us what you need and we'll point you to the right next step.</p>
  <div class="cta-band__actions">
    <a class="btn btn--secondary-on-dark btn--pill-outline" href="{{ enquiryUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Message us on WhatsApp</a>
    <a class="btn btn--secondary-on-dark btn--pill-outline" href="/contact/">Contact details</a>
  </div>
</section>
